c(26, "§3.3 P3", "contradiction", "P3 simplicity — PRAISE_SIMPLICITY 14 (19.72%, 4.57★) — and it has a ceiling: the same quality reads as emptiness to four (UX_TOO_MINIMAL 4, 5.63%, mean 2.25★: 'Maybe too simple'; 'This app lacks the punch'; '미니멀을 넘어서 좀 휑하다' — beyond minimal, it feels bare; 'nothing special'); two of those four also praise the design in the same review; minimalism is the third-largest praise and the joint-largest non-monetary complaint.", "minimal feature set", "mixed", "PRAISE_SIMPLICITY 14 / 4.57★ vs UX_TOO_MINIMAL 4 / 2.25★", "undecided", "High-priority", "generalisable", ["12806969276", "12809333699", "12552768633", "12339835181", "12579762746", "13200826254"], "", "")

